    <id>urn:uuid:1225c695-cfb8-4ebb-aaaa-80da344efa6a</id>
    <published>2026-08-04T09:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-08-04T10:00:00Z</updated>
    <summary type="text">Basic workflows and dev containers work well; a few gaps still stop it replacing Docker Desktop.</summary>
    <content type="text">Microsoft's built-in container runtime for WSL handles basic workflows and dev containers well. Two limitations still prevent it replacing Docker Desktop outright, and both are worth knowing before you switch.</content>
